  "content": "<div style=\"text-align:left\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/U3iMWt0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"2253\" height=\"682\"></div><div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">此為 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>OctoStudios</strong></a> 模組中共享程式碼的集合。目前已實現的功能列表：</div><div style=\"text-align:left\">\n<ul>\n<li>類似資料包的 YAML 配置系統，具備自動驗證、深度序列化及其他安全性功能。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">注意：</span></strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>從 1.20.1 版本開始，需要 <a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/architectury-api\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>ArchitecturyAPI</strong></a> 才能正常運作！</li>\n</ul>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iZ9jS3Q.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"473\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>1.21.1：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NEOFORGE</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FABRIC</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.21&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5&amp;showAlphaFiles=show\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>QUILT</strong></a></li>\n<li>1.20.1：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>NEOFORGE</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=4\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>FABRIC</strong></a> | <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/octo-lib/files/all?page=1&amp;pageSize=20&amp;version=1.20.1&amp;gameVersionTypeId=5&amp;showAlphaFiles=show\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>QUILT</strong></a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果你是模組開發者，不建議使用此模組，因為此 API 的程式碼基礎有時可能會有較大變動，但你若仍想使用，也無妨～</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/y1xHFF7.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"453\" height=\"100\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/relics-mod\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/914/338/638371376399491795.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/immersive-ui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1004/48/638524944427495074.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/notenoughrecipebook\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/874/685/638296140689427443.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cardiac\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/1028/412/638550182333901334.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\"></a></p>\n</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7Thcq1K.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1080\"></div><div style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><hr></div><div style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/pHren9yxzW\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/gG6f4t0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Octo-Studios/octo-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/sK6KJcQ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252focto-lib\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/OYN08d0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.paypal.com%252fcgi-bin%252fwebscr%253freturn%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252focto-lib%2526cn%253dAdd%2bspecial%2binstructions%2bto%2bthe%2baddon%2bauthor()%2526business%253dp%2540foxy.cat%2526bn%253dPP-DonationsBF%253abtn_donateCC_LG.gif%253aNonHosted%2526cancel_return%253dhttps%253a%252f%252fwww.curseforge.com%252fminecraft%252fmc-mods%252focto-lib%2526lc%253dUS%2526item_name%253dOctoLib%2b(from%2bwww.curseforge.com)%2526cmd%253d_donations%2526rm%253d1%2526no_shipping%253d1%2526currency_code%253dUSD\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/fPIlVls.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"136\" height=\"136\"></a></div><div><hr></div><div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>想試試我們的其他模組嗎？請前往 <span style=\"color:#b96ad9\"><a style=\"color:#b96ad9\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252focto-studios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OCTO-STUDIOS.COM</a></span> 獲取更多資訊！</strong></p>\n</div>",
